{#
   Plot map (#plot-map): every town where a player owns a plot, on a pixel world map, with
   who owns each plot and which club stands on it (Courtney, 2026-11-27).

   Placed right after #journey, whose Chapter 01 is "First, buy your ground": the map is
   that chapter's proof that real people have.

   THE LAND LAYER is public/images/world-pixel.png, generated by scripts/geo (Natural
   Earth land, public domain) on a plain longitude/latitude grid and scaled up with
   image-rendering: pixelated. Because the grid is equirectangular, a town is placed in
   Twig with two divisions and no map library. WORLD_MAP_BOUNDS below must match the
   bounds in scripts/geo/build-world-pixel.mjs (W -180, E 180, N 84, S -58).

   DATA is plotMap from OwnedPlotsMapService (10-minute cache): one entry per town, owner
   in-game names ('Anonymous' when unset) and club names only, spoof accounts left out.
   An empty map still renders, with a "be the first" line, because the section explains
   plot ownership as much as it lists it.

   HOVER / TAP. Each dot is a button holding its own popover. CSS opens it on :hover and
   :focus-visible; landing.js toggles .is-open on tap, because iOS Safari does not focus a
   button on tap. Dots in the right third open their popover leftwards (.pmap-dot--left),
   and dots in the top third open it downwards (.pmap-dot--down), so it stays on the map.
#}
{% set WORLD_MAP_BOUNDS = { west: -180, east: 180, north: 84, south: -58 } %}
{% set towns = plotMap.towns ?? [] %}
<section class="pmap-section" id="plot-map" aria-labelledby="pmap-title">
    <div class="wrap">
        <div class="section-label">Owned ground</div>
        <h2 class="section-title" id="pmap-title">WHO OWNS THE WORLD</h2>
        <p class="section-sub">
            {% if plotMap.totals.plots > 0 %}
                {{ plotMap.totals.plots|number_format }} {{ plotMap.totals.plots == 1 ? 'plot' : 'plots' }} owned in {{ plotMap.totals.towns|number_format }} {{ plotMap.totals.towns == 1 ? 'town' : 'towns' }} across {{ plotMap.totals.countries }} {{ plotMap.totals.countries == 1 ? 'country' : 'countries' }}. Hover or tap a marker to see who owns the ground and which club plays on it.
            {% else %}
                No plots are owned yet. Buy your ground and yours will be the first marker on the map.
            {% endif %}
        </p>

        <div class="pmap-frame">
            <div class="pmap-map">
                <img class="pmap-land" src="{{ asset('images/world-pixel.png') }}?v={{ landing_v }}" width="480" height="189" alt="" decoding="async" loading="lazy">
                {% for t in towns %}
                    {% set x = (t.lng - WORLD_MAP_BOUNDS.west) / (WORLD_MAP_BOUNDS.east - WORLD_MAP_BOUNDS.west) * 100 %}
                    {% set y = (WORLD_MAP_BOUNDS.north - t.lat) / (WORLD_MAP_BOUNDS.north - WORLD_MAP_BOUNDS.south) * 100 %}
                    {% if y >= 0 and y <= 100 %}
                        <button type="button"
                                class="pmap-dot{{ x > 66 ? ' pmap-dot--left' }}{{ y < 34 ? ' pmap-dot--down' }}{{ t.plotCount > 1 ? ' pmap-dot--multi' }}"
                                style="left: {{ x|round(3) }}%; top: {{ y|round(3) }}%;"
                                aria-label="{{ t.town }}, {{ t.countryName }}: {{ t.plotCount }} owned {{ t.plotCount == 1 ? 'plot' : 'plots' }}">
                            {% if t.plotCount > 1 %}<span class="pmap-count pixel" aria-hidden="true">{{ t.plotCount }}</span>{% endif %}
                            <span class="pmap-pop" role="tooltip">
                                <span class="pmap-pop-head">
                                    <img class="pmap-flag" src="/assets/flags/{{ t.countryCode|lower }}.svg" width="18" height="13" alt="{{ t.countryName }}" title="{{ t.countryName }}">
                                    <span class="pmap-town pixel">{{ t.town|upper }}</span>
                                </span>
                                <span class="pmap-region">{{ t.region is not empty ? t.region ~ ', ' }}{{ t.countryName }} · {{ t.plotCount }} {{ t.plotCount == 1 ? 'plot' : 'plots' }} owned</span>
                                <span class="pmap-owners">
                                    {% for o in t.owners %}
                                        <span class="pmap-owner">
                                            <span class="pmap-owner-name">{{ o.ownerName }}</span>
                                            <span class="pmap-club">{{ o.clubName ?? 'Empty plot' }}</span>
                                        </span>
                                    {% endfor %}
                                    {% if t.plotCount > t.owners|length %}
                                        <span class="pmap-more">+ {{ t.plotCount - t.owners|length }} more</span>
                                    {% endif %}
                                </span>
                            </span>
                        </button>
                    {% endif %}
                {% endfor %}
            </div>
        </div>
        <p class="pmap-credit">Map data: Natural Earth.</p>
    </div>
</section>
